<view class="container container--no-tabbar">
  <view class="page-header">
    <view class="g-flex-between">
      <view class="back-btn" bindtap="onBack">
        <text class="iconfont icon-arrow-left iconfont--primary iconfont--sm"></text>
      </view>
      <view class="page-header__title">药效趋势</view>
      <view class="page-header__placeholder"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="g-card effect-card">
    <view class="g-card__title">注射后药效变化</view>
    <view class="effect-curve">
      <view class="effect-curve__item" wx:for="{{effectDays}}" wx:key="day">
        <view class="effect-curve__day">{{item.day}}</view>
        <view class="effect-curve__bar-wrap">
          <view class="effect-curve__bar" style="width: {{item.value}}"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="effect-curve__value effect-curve__value--{{item.value > 80 ? 'high' : (item.value > 50 ? 'mid' : 'low')}}">
          {{item.value}}
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="g-card effect-info">
    <view class="g-card__title">药效说明</view>
    <view class="effect-info__text">司美格鲁肽注射后，药效在体内逐渐衰减。</view>
    <view class="effect-info__text">建议在药效较高期间（D1-D3）配合饮食控制效果更佳。</view>
  </view>
</view>
